    {
        "content": "<p>Hi,</p>\n<p>I've recently started using nael-mode (and Lean) , and the proof state prints and evolves both in the eldoc-buffer and the echo area. The latter is quite annoying.</p>\n<p>Is this expected behavior or is something wrong with my config?</p>",
        "id": 624320562,
        "sender_full_name": "Alex Loitzl 🦆",
        "timestamp": 1789472744
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>It seems like it is, but I think this is annoying.<br>\nSee <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/mekeor/nael/issues/48\">issue #48</a> and <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/mekeor/nael/pulls/49\">PR #49</a></p>",
        "id": 625684586,
        "sender_full_name": "Alex Loitzl 🦆",
        "timestamp": 1789983000
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Try setting <code>eldoc-echo-area-prefer-doc-buffer</code> to <code>t</code></p>",
        "id": 625721939,
        "sender_full_name": "Alessio Duè",
        "timestamp": 1789993559
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Thanks, updated the issue.</p>",
        "id": 625797013,
